  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Climate Response Fund - specialist knowledge</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is one of a number of activities collectively assessed under the umbrella of &#x2018;the Strategic Climate Response Fund&#x2019;, where the aim is to capitalise on opportunities to work with 15-20 high quality led workstreams to leverage support for increasing national resilience to climate change responses impacts and drive sustainable low carbon growth.  This project will provide specific specialist climate change advice to Posts in the Middle East and North Africa to help in a number of ways including ensuring that all Climate action is recognised and reported or identifying opportunities for Financing.</narrative>
  </description>
